---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PricingCard from '../../components/PricingCard.astro';
import MetricCard from '../../components/MetricCard.astro';
import IndustryBadge from '../../components/IndustryBadge.astro';
import QuoteBlock from '../../components/QuoteBlock.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="AI Inbox — 5-Minute Replies, Automatically"
  description="An AI assistant that drafts replies to every inquiry within 5 minutes — in your business's voice, with your pricing, with human approval on every send. Start with a free 30-minute consultation."
  ogImage="/og-ai-inbox.png"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
          <IndustryBadge label="For High-Touch Service Businesses" variant="wedding" />
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6">
          Never Lose a Lead to a Slow Reply Again
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          The first to reply wins the booking. We send a thoughtful, on-brand first response to every inquiry within 5 minutes — so you book more business without staying glued to your inbox.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a href="/contact/?service=ai-inbox" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-blue-500 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors text-lg min-h-[44px]">
            Book a Free Consultation →
          </a>
          <a href="/tools/email-response-grader/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors text-lg min-h-[44px]">
            Grade My Current Response Time
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The problem -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-wider">The Problem</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-6">Your Inquiry Form Is Working. Your Reply Time Isn't.</h2>
      <div class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-lg">
        <p>You get 20 to 40 inquiries a week. Some you reply to in an hour. Most wait until the next morning — after the day's chaos, the site visits, the customer calls, the actual work — when you finally sit down with coffee.</p>
        <p>By then, half those prospects have already booked with whoever replied first.</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-navy-950">The data is brutal: industry studies consistently show that responding to an inquiry within 5 minutes makes a prospect <strong>9× more likely</strong> to convert than the same reply at 4 hours. Most small businesses reply in 12+.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The solution -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-wider">How It Works</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-4 text-center">An AI Assistant That Replies Like You Would — Just Faster</h2>
      <p class="text-center text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 text-lg">We build a private AI assistant trained on your business's voice, pricing, packages, and policies. Every inquiry gets a thoughtful first response within 5 minutes. You stay in control.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📥</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-950 mb-2">Inquiry lands in your inbox</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">From your website form, lead-gen platforms (The Knot, WeddingWire, Thumbtack, Yelp), Instagram DMs — wherever leads come from. We connect to Microsoft 365 or Google Workspace; no migration needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🤖</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-950 mb-2">AI drafts a personalized reply</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Within 60 seconds. In your tone. References the details they actually care about — date, party size, location, scope of work. Includes the right packet + a calendar link to book a call or tour.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">✓</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-950 mb-2">You approve, it sends</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Quick mobile push: tap to approve, tap to edit, tap to skip. Default mode is human-in-the-loop. Trusted senders (returning customers, established partners) can auto-send without approval.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy-950 mb-3">What it will NOT do (because you asked):</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 flex-shrink-0">✗</span> Quote a binding price without your approval</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 flex-shrink-0">✗</span> Commit to a date or hold a date</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 flex-shrink-0">✗</span> Negotiate, discount, or modify your packages</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 flex-shrink-0">✗</span> Send anything you haven't signed off on (in approval mode)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Results -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Real Results</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-12 text-center">What Happens After 4 Weeks</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <MetricCard label="Reply Time" before="4 hours" after="8 min" caption="Average first response time across all inquiries" />
        <MetricCard label="Leads Captured" before="48%" after="68%" caption="Inquiries that book a tour or callback" />
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-10">
        <a href="/work/inquiry-response-automation/" class="text-blue-500 font-medium hover:underline text-lg">
          Read the full case study →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Pricing</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-4 text-center">Simple Setup, Then a Flat Monthly Fee.</h2>
      <p class="text-center text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 text-lg">A one-time setup gets you live, then a flat monthly fee covers running it and ongoing optimization — all scoped on your free consultation.</p>

      <PricingCard
        productName="AI Inbox"
        headline="Free consultation to start"
        features={[
          "Custom AI assistant trained on your business's voice + pricing + packages",
          "Inquiry monitoring across Microsoft 365 or Google Workspace",
          "5-minute first-response SLA (we'll show you the daily numbers)",
          "Human-in-the-loop approval via mobile push (or auto-send for trusted senders)",
          "Calendar integration for booking calls or tours (Calendly, HubSpot, Google Calendar)",
          "Direct support from Nick — not a chatbot, not a ticket queue",
          "Audit log of every draft, edit, approval, and send",
          "No long-term contract — 30-day notice to cancel, your data exports cleanly",
        ]}
        ctaText="Book Your Consultation"
        ctaHref="/contact/?service=ai-inbox"
        footnote="Built for high-touch service businesses: wedding venues, photographers, planners, caterers, transportation operators, contractors, agencies."
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust + Security -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Trust + Security</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-6">Your Inquiries Stay Yours</h2>
      <div class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-lg">
        <p>Your inbox content is processed in your dedicated, encrypted-at-rest environment. We don't train AI models on your customer data, we don't share it with other clients, and we'll sign a Data Processing Agreement before we touch your inbox.</p>
        <p>Full data-handling details on the <a href="/security/" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline font-medium">Security &amp; Trust page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-navy-950 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">See How Fast Your Business Currently Replies</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 mb-8">Paste any recent inquiry into our free grader. We'll show you the response-time grade — and an honest estimate of the revenue at risk.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/tools/email-response-grader/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white text-navy-950 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-lg min-h-[44px]">
          Try the Free Grader →
        </a>
        <a href="/contact/?service=ai-inbox" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors text-lg min-h-[44px]">
          Talk to Nick
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
